#
#   serialize - CSS serialization: declarations, component values, positional lists
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Serialize.cpp (lines 125-131 and 180-354) and the template of
#       Serialize.h (lines 33-46). The identifier, string, URL and number serializers (lines
#       18-178) are css_syntax's (DESIGN.md §4.1.3: tokens use them); this half needs the
#       engine's style values.
